usage: regvelo.py [-h] --config CONFIG [--tf TF [TF ...]] [--resume]
                  {audit,prepare,fit,velocity,fate,grn,perturb,visualize,report,all}

RegVelo: official GRN-aware RNA dynamics / 官方模型流程

positional arguments:
  {audit,prepare,fit,velocity,fate,grn,perturb,visualize,report,all}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       JSON config; paths resolve relative to its directory
  --tf TF [TF ...]      Override perturb.tfs; gene identifiers are case-
                        sensitive
  --resume              Skip completed stages with the same config and
                        existing artifacts
